00:33:17.720 --> 00:33:19.819
but then again, that could simply be a matter of time.

00:33:21.160 --> 00:33:23.240
What exactly is it that you want?

00:33:25.019 --> 00:33:27.279
I want you to do what you do best, doctor.

00:33:27.279 --> 00:33:27.339
Doctor.

00:33:32.799 --> 00:33:33.160
Biology.

00:33:33.740 --> 00:33:35.299
So you want me to do what you do best?

00:33:35.299 --> 00:33:37.599
How do you suggest I do that?

00:33:37.599 --> 00:33:39.299
The university won't even let me in the building.

00:33:39.319 --> 00:33:42.000
I'm going to fund your research, doctor.

00:33:42.000 --> 00:33:45.140
Consider your budget doubled.

00:33:45.140 --> 00:33:48.779
You'll have access to whatever equipment you require,

00:33:48.779 --> 00:33:50.819
as long as you tell me where the platelets come from

00:33:50.819 --> 00:33:52.220
and what you're using them for.

00:33:52.220 --> 00:33:54.319
I'll do whatever you need.

00:33:54.319 --> 00:33:55.079
All right?

00:33:55.079 --> 00:33:57.299
All right.

00:33:57.299 --> 00:33:58.160
All right.

00:33:58.160 --> 00:34:00.759
All right.

00:34:00.759 --> 00:34:02.539
All right.

00:34:02.539 --> 00:34:02.819
All right.

00:34:02.819 --> 00:34:03.180
All right.

00:34:03.180 --> 00:34:03.519
All right.

00:34:03.519 --> 00:34:05.519
Okay.

00:34:33.519 --> 00:34:35.519
Adam? Are you there?

00:34:35.559 --> 00:34:37.559
Be right out.

00:34:40.559 --> 00:34:42.559
Adam?

00:34:43.559 --> 00:34:45.559
Are you okay?

00:34:52.559 --> 00:34:54.559
Fine.

00:34:55.559 --> 00:34:57.559
Um, Adam, I kept my word.

00:34:57.599 --> 00:34:59.559
I didn't tell anyone about Chad and Ash.

00:34:59.599 --> 00:35:01.559
But I think I deserve an explanation.

00:35:01.599 --> 00:35:02.559
I'm sorry.

00:35:02.599 --> 00:35:03.480
I'm sorry.

00:35:03.559 --> 00:35:04.559
I don't need an explanation.

00:35:04.599 --> 00:35:08.559
Look, Lana, this is bigger than you realize.

00:35:08.599 --> 00:35:10.559
Whatever you know, just forget about it.

00:35:10.599 --> 00:35:11.559
For your own good.

00:35:11.599 --> 00:35:13.559
No, Adam, I can't do that.

00:35:13.599 --> 00:35:15.559
If you're gonna live here,

00:35:15.599 --> 00:35:17.559
you're going to have to be honest with me.

00:35:19.599 --> 00:35:21.559
You want the truth?

00:35:24.599 --> 00:35:27.559
I'll make it real clear to you.

00:35:27.599 --> 00:35:30.559
Tell anyone what you found out,

00:35:30.599 --> 00:35:32.559
and you're gonna regret ever meeting me.

00:35:32.599 --> 00:35:33.480
Okay.

00:35:33.519 --> 00:35:34.820
But most importantly,

00:35:35.500 --> 00:35:38.619
I need you to tell Emily I love her.

00:35:46.599 --> 00:35:50.599
I don't have to tell anyone.

00:35:50.639 --> 00:35:52.440
I can look at her anymore,

00:35:52.480 --> 00:35:53.559
and tell her I understand.

00:35:53.599 --> 00:35:54.539
That's enough.

00:35:54.579 --> 00:35:56.420
I will take that dead body.

00:35:56.460 --> 00:35:57.599
I'll tell them,

00:35:57.639 --> 00:35:58.639
and they'll know

00:35:58.659 --> 00:35:59.639
that they didn't kill me.

00:35:59.679 --> 00:36:00.599
I need that body.

00:36:01.519 --> 00:36:02.599
Hey, Barry.

00:36:02.599 --> 00:36:05.039
I was wondering what ever happened with your friend.

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:08.019
Turns out the dog's bark is bigger than his bite.

00:36:09.179 --> 00:36:10.819
I had a feeling you'd work it out, Clark.

00:36:13.099 --> 00:36:15.119
You know, the oddest thing happened yesterday.

00:36:17.039 --> 00:36:18.319
After I talked to you,

00:36:18.440 --> 00:36:21.559
my silver Porsche was seen speeding off the grounds.

00:36:24.079 --> 00:36:25.019
Someone stole it?

00:36:27.019 --> 00:36:27.900
Not exactly.

00:36:27.900 --> 00:36:32.559
By the time I got in, it was resting in my garage.

00:36:32.599 --> 00:36:34.599
Snug in its car cover.

00:36:36.199 --> 00:36:36.960
That's odd.

00:36:38.279 --> 00:36:39.299
Glad you got it back.

00:36:40.179 --> 00:36:40.460
Yeah.

00:36:41.500 --> 00:36:43.360
My security thinks it was a joyrider,

00:36:43.500 --> 00:36:45.440
but I'm not so sure.

00:36:47.699 --> 00:36:48.719
Why? What do you think happened?

00:36:49.699 --> 00:36:50.519
I don't know.

00:36:52.619 --> 00:36:55.199
But I understand what it's like to have a friend in need, Clark.

00:36:56.360 --> 00:36:59.239
Sometimes you have to cross the moral line to come to their aid.

00:37:01.880 --> 00:37:02.579
Often that could be a good thing.

00:37:02.679 --> 00:37:03.980
It could be the test of true friendship.

00:37:09.599 --> 00:37:10.539
Give your dad my regards.

00:37:10.639 --> 00:37:12.219
Never again.

00:37:12.679 --> 00:37:16.259
discuss this about him?

00:37:18.579 --> 00:37:19.860
Numberselling

00:37:20.099 --> 00:37:22.679
Do you see DC Best?

00:37:23.059 --> 00:37:25.319
And then do a footage?

00:37:25.599 --> 00:37:29.039
I don't truly know if you're a new funk that's how you play it.

00:37:29.119 --> 00:37:30.980
So that could be a good thing you've got.

00:37:31.059 --> 00:37:32.039
Edward.

00:37:32.039 --> 00:37:36.300
The words home sweet home have never been truer.

00:37:36.679 --> 00:37:37.719
Come on, Dad, let's get your feet up.

00:37:38.420 --> 00:37:40.039
Clark, I don't need to put my feet up.

00:37:40.079 --> 00:37:40.840
They've been up for a week.

00:37:40.920 --> 00:37:43.139
The doctor said that I need to rest.

00:37:43.179 --> 00:37:43.779
I'm not an invalid.

00:37:44.039 --> 00:37:45.059
Well, I'm gonna make some lunch.

00:37:45.159 --> 00:37:46.599
I got you some low-sodium turkey.

00:37:46.920 --> 00:37:47.779
Low-sodium turkey?

00:37:49.340 --> 00:37:49.659
Jonathan.

00:37:51.279 --> 00:37:52.179
Sounds good, sweetheart.

00:37:53.980 --> 00:37:55.099
Clark, sit down.

00:37:59.420 --> 00:38:00.159
Listen, son.

00:38:00.159 --> 00:38:02.399
It doesn't take a genius to realize

00:38:02.399 --> 00:38:04.319
that something's been bothering you other than my health lately.

00:38:04.399 --> 00:38:04.739
What's up?

00:38:07.339 --> 00:38:07.659
Hmm?

00:38:09.559 --> 00:38:11.920
While you were in the hospital, Pete got himself into a bind.

00:38:13.739 --> 00:38:15.460
I did some things I'm not too proud of.

00:38:17.460 --> 00:38:18.960
Well, your mother and I trust your judgment.

00:38:20.339 --> 00:38:22.519
We didn't raise you to know the difference

00:38:22.519 --> 00:38:23.279
between right and wrong.

00:38:25.179 --> 00:38:26.759
Clark, one day when we're not around anymore,

00:38:26.799 --> 00:38:27.920
I'm sure that you're gonna remember it.

00:38:30.159 --> 00:38:33.379
Look, in the world,

00:38:33.779 --> 00:38:35.659
things aren't always black and white.

00:38:36.480 --> 00:38:38.879
I mean, sometimes you gotta just wander out into the gray areas

00:38:38.879 --> 00:38:40.000
and do what you think is best.

00:38:42.379 --> 00:38:43.119
What do you mean?

00:38:48.119 --> 00:38:49.759
Clark, I did go talk to Jarrell.

00:38:50.759 --> 00:38:53.179
I think maybe that is why my heart gave out.

00:38:54.199 --> 00:38:55.159
But listen, son.

00:38:56.579 --> 00:38:58.739
I went into that cave knowing full well

00:38:58.739 --> 00:38:59.980
that there were risks involved.

00:39:00.159 --> 00:39:02.460
And I'd do it again if I thought you were in trouble.

00:39:02.899 --> 00:39:05.339
Dad, I promise I'll never put you in that position again.

00:39:06.179 --> 00:39:08.319
Clark, that's not what this is about.

00:39:10.480 --> 00:39:12.319
You're different than your mother and I.

00:39:13.399 --> 00:39:15.239
Son, you're gonna have to make choices in your life,

00:39:15.339 --> 00:39:19.019
moral choices that she and I will never have to make.

00:39:20.679 --> 00:39:23.719
But we both know that when that time comes,

00:39:24.339 --> 00:39:27.440
you'll do what you think is best.

00:39:27.440 --> 00:39:29.639
What's right.

00:39:30.159 --> 00:39:32.519
That's what's important.

00:39:32.519 --> 00:39:54.519
Hey.

00:39:54.519 --> 00:39:55.920
Hey.

00:39:55.920 --> 00:39:55.960
Hey.

00:40:00.159 --> 00:40:00.879
Look, I...

00:40:00.899 --> 00:40:03.699
I know you probably mad as hell at me.

00:40:04.299 --> 00:40:05.500
To be honest, I don't blame you.

00:40:07.659 --> 00:40:08.920
All I can say is I'm sorry.

00:40:11.519 --> 00:40:12.480
I am too, Pete.

00:40:13.319 --> 00:40:15.599
I had to steal from one friend to help another.

00:40:17.199 --> 00:40:18.279
And someone died.

00:40:20.599 --> 00:40:21.199
I know.

00:40:24.019 --> 00:40:25.460
If I had listened to you from the start,

00:40:25.460 --> 00:40:26.359
none of this would have happened.

00:40:29.440 --> 00:40:30.019
Clark, listen.

00:40:30.159 --> 00:40:34.099
You told me a secret because I'm your friend.

00:40:34.099 --> 00:40:37.460
And at times, that's not an easy thing to be.

00:40:37.460 --> 00:40:40.899
But it doesn't give me the right to do what I did.

00:40:40.899 --> 00:40:45.739
I just want to say that, Clark, I swear

00:40:45.739 --> 00:40:47.039
it will never happen again.

00:40:52.440 --> 00:40:54.819
Clark, I know I let you down.

00:40:54.819 --> 00:40:57.839
But I promise you until the day that I die,

00:40:57.840 --> 00:40:59.640
I will never disrespect your powers again.

00:41:08.240 --> 00:41:09.220
You want to play some hoops?

00:41:12.200 --> 00:41:14.660
I was just about to go inside.

00:41:14.660 --> 00:41:15.960
Come on.

00:41:15.960 --> 00:41:17.900
Game of 21 by twos.

00:41:17.900 --> 00:41:20.120
Three pointers outside of the crack, no powers.

00:41:25.600 --> 00:41:26.500
Not today, Pete.

00:41:27.840 --> 00:41:36.519
Two days going to be the day that they're

00:41:36.519 --> 00:41:39.920
going to give it back to you.

00:41:39.920 --> 00:41:45.660
By now, you should have somehow realized what you got to do.

00:41:45.660 --> 00:41:51.039
I don't believe in anybody who feels the way I do about you

00:41:51.039 --> 00:41:51.539
now.

00:42:27.840 --> 00:42:57.820
Thank you.

